{"id":"en_the-life-changing-flight","title":"The Life-Changing Flight","titleEn":"The Life-Changing Flight","description":"A pregnant woman asks for the seat of the narrator, who agrees and moves to an upgraded seat instead. Soon afterward, the woman and her husband are removed from the flight because of safety violations. The couple then tries to damage the narrator's reputation online, but the narrator is ready for them. A lawsuit follows, the narrator wins, and their career takes off. The couple finally understands that they targeted the wrong person.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-life-changing-flight/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-life-changing-flight/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Faceslapping","Melodrama","Good Girl"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjs/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-life-changing-flight_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjs/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-life-changing-flight_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjs/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-life-changing-flight_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjs/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-life-changing-flight_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dimjs/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-life-changing-flight_5","title":"Episode 5","sea